        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe our principal competitive factors in our market are: vision for commerce and product strategy, simplicity and ease of use for merchants and their buyers, integration of multiple sales channels, cost-effective solutions, breadth and depth of functionality, pace of innovation, ability to leverage emerging technologies, including AI, ability to scale, security and reliability, and brand recognition and reputation.",
