        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We categorize markets based on annual revenue, specifically: SB typically range from $0.5 million to $5.0 million and any business with annual revenue greater than $5.0 million are included within either of our B2B or B2C customer base.",
